        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-f7d28995258f43d8b02d73d0103556dd",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Transfer to the airport for your flight to Buenos Aires.\n\nOn arrival, your driver will take you to your hotel.\n\nIn Buenos Aires, European architecture meets South American culture in a city of green parks, museums, restaurants and tango.\n\nIn the evening, a New Year’s Eve programme is planned with a tango show and dinner.\n\nThe show is accompanied by a traditional dinner and Argentine wine.\n\nAfter the show, return to your hotel.\n\nAccommodation at Alvear Art Hotel."
